{"text":"I've meant to write to her, I've meant to call her, but you know our modern lifestyles can keep us so far away from the people we love most. And it seems that the more ways there are for us to communicate, the harder it is for us to do. So by sharing this with you today, I hope to kill two birds with one stone. The dictionary defines them as a series of thoughts, images, and sensations occurring in our brains when we are asleep or relaxing. The dreaming I would like to speak to is that glimpse of the thing you want to do that would make you feel most alive. A dream as a portal to your purpose. My dream was to be an actor from when I was really young, but I didn't always know it. Before I could call myself an actor, I had a lot of stuff to do. I had to unchain myself from indecision. I had to cut through fear, the fear of going after my dream, jump over my own ego and embrace vulnerability and confront","words":[{"text":"I've","start":1.08,"end":1.52},{"text":"meant","start":1.52,"end":1.68},{"text":"to","start":1.68,"end":1.86},{"text":"write","start":1.86,"end":2.06},{"text":"to","start":2.06,"end":2.28},{"text":"her","start":2.28,"end":2.6,"punct":","},{"text":"I've","start":2.92,"end":3.02},{"text":"meant","start":3.02,"end":3.18},{"text":"to","start":3.18,"end":3.32},{"text":"call","start":3.32,"end":3.6},{"text":"her","start":3.6,"end":3.96,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":4.14,"end":4.26},{"text":"you","start":4.26,"end":4.64},{"text":"know","start":4.64,"end":4.76},{"text":"our","start":4.76,"end":4.94},{"text":"modern","start":4.94,"end":5.24},{"text":"lifestyles","start":5.24,"end":5.8},{"text":"can","start":5.8,"end":6.12},{"text":"keep","start":6.12,"end":6.38},{"text":"us","start":6.38,"end":6.58},{"text":"so","start":6.58,"end":6.98},{"text":"far","start":6.98,"end":7.2},{"text":"away","start":7.2,"end":7.44},{"text":"from","start":7.44,"end":7.62},{"text":"the","start":7.62,"end":7.76},{"text":"people","start":7.76,"end":7.94},{"text":"we","